            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story：</h2><br>   A monster from hell has kidnapped your lover and sucked her blood, and now it's your job to go into the netherworld to save her from the beast.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay：</h2><br>    Collecting bloods cells throughout each stage you can accumulate a variety of weird and wonderful power-ups and abilities to help you defeat whatever the damned throw at you. Be warned, it's not going to be easy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features：</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Accumulate energy to get gain power-ups and new abilities; easy to use, difficult to master</li><li>Fantastic props</li><li>Procedurally generated dungeons and catacombs</li><li>A wide variety of monsters and unique boss battles</li><li>Hidden areas to discover</li></ul><br><br>Soundtrack by CodeManu, Joth and nene.<br>Sound design by SubspaceAudio",
